  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2027, primary healthcare (PHC) system&apos;s capacity is strengthened to be more resilient and shock-responsive, in both development
and humanitarian situation, for an  integrated delivery of PHC services including life saving vaccines and response to health
emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
